ason: (C, 1) allows me to capitalize on my control of the A1 corner. It captures a significant number of pieces (4) and secures a portion of the left edge. By controlling A1 and C1 with B1 empty and inaccessible to the opponent, I establish a secure zone that restricts the opponent's future moves in that quadrant.\n\nAnswer: (C, 1)"}
